which thing, but they can all affect cancer.

00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:40,490
Yeah, I don't know if there's any articles or research, if that's what you're asking, about the

00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:49,770
connection with all those things with cancer, for sure. If you go on the chronic disease in autoimmune

00:00:49,770 --> 00:01:01,130
course, module six is all about thyroid, that may be helpful to you. As far as liver function

